      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Add Claw manifest export command",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nClaws now have a creation path, not only an apply/status/remove path. This PR adds `openclaw claws export` so a user can create a Claw manifest from selected local OpenClaw state and workspace files, with include/exclude controls that make starter setup authoring practical.\n\nThis stacks on the Claws RFC PR openclaw/rfcs#27 and the lifecycle stack, especially #102296.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Adds `claws export --id --name` with `--include`, `--exclude`, `--plugin`, `--workspace-file`, and `--persona` selection controls.\n- Exports installed plugins from the installed plugin index into reusable artifact selectors.\n- Writes self-contained file exports with sidecar `files/...` sources when `--out` is used, so the result can feed `claws apply` directly.\n- Keeps plugin-only stdout export as raw manifest JSON for shell redirection.\n- Rejects empty exports, requires `--out` for workspace/persona file exports, skips symlink escapes, skips oversized/non-regular files, deduplicates targets, and guarantees unique manifest entry ids.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/claws/schema.test.ts src/claws/provenance.test.ts src/claws/artifact-installers.test.ts src/claws/workspace.test.ts src/claws/lifecycle-state.test.ts src/state/openclaw-state-db.test.ts src/cli/claws-cli.test.ts src/cli/plugins-cli.uninstall.test.ts src/claws/lifecycle.e2e.test.ts src/cli/program/command-registry.test.ts src/cli/program/root-command-descriptions.test.ts`\n- Real CLI proof: `claws export --out ... --include workspace,persona --workspace-file runbooks/incident.md --persona SOUL.md --json` followed by `claws apply <exported manifest> --workspace <target> --yes --json`; verified sidecar `files/...` and two applied workspace files.\n- `git diff --check`\n- `node scripts/check-no-conflict-markers.mjs`\n- `codex review -c model=gpt-5.5 --uncommitted` reported no actionable correctness issues after fixes.\n\n## Not Tested\n\n- Full `pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit --pretty false` is still blocked by the existing unrelated `src/secrets/config-io.ts` TS4058 (`configWritePostCommitRollback` return type naming), outside this diff.\n",
